                <pb facs="0810" n="796" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg796"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center"><seg type="margin">[77]</seg> *[Inclosure No. 3.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barlow, United
                        States marshal, to Mr. Hoar,
                        Attorney-General.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To the <hi rendition="#small-caps">Attorney-General</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York City</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">June</hi> 30, 1860.</p>
                <p>We have captured the McCool, John Chase, and Mabey, three of the expedition tugs,
                    with men, arms, and ammunition on board. The expedition is wholly broken up.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FRANCIS C. BARLOW,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States
                            Marshal.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
